                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0486dcb-0e04-4ac2-b228-51be9a97c450",
                                                "sense_id": "f46fae2e-2e7b-3394-930f-8b70849a4f83",
                                                "text": "The radar's detection was confirmed visually, because seeing is believing."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1db5fe33-2639-432c-9561-2b9cfe909040",
                                                "sense_id": "f46fae2e-2e7b-3394-930f-8b70849a4f83",
                                                "text": "He explained that engineers had been able to examine the bridge visually, and had started surveying likely sites for access roads and where to place the heavyweight crawler crane. NR was also ordering the aggregates needed for the access roads."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2e8ecd83-2dcd-4eab-93e0-54b81e2d7be4",
                        "source_entry_id": "cc3c0a0d-bf99-36b3-8df4-40012bdc8d09",
                        "source_sense_id": "f50fe342-e369-3a1e-a0f3-ac7fb56a3016",
